Subject: [PATCH] PAIR II impersonation arms: persona and a pinned request
 prefix

benchmark.spoof = { persona, prefix? }. The true requester (benchmark.requester)
still selects the labels and must match an identity header. The persona selects
the requester's agent files and the identity in its task queue. The prefix, one
of three pinned texts in dataset/pact-pair/spoof, is written with a blank line
at the head of every messages.request the requester sends, after the model's
call is recorded in the requester's own context and before SharedOS receives
it. Without the block nothing changes.

